@@ -2927,14 +2927,20 @@
         // non-init one (mirrors _fast_init_invokestatic being whitelisted next to
         // _fast_invokestatic, below). The class BASE is materialized GC-safely via the class_list
         // indirection (CodeGenerator::move(Value&,Oop*) = get_class_by_id) -- no moveable oop
-        // baked into native code -- then load/store at the static field offset. NOT covered:
