-        // a final object-static get (a compile-time object immediate -> needs oop relocation the
-        // r5900 lacks; see move(Value&,Oop*)). Length 3 (ADVANCE(3) in the interp handlers).
+        // baked into native code -- then load/store at the static field offset. Group 6 adds
+        // the OBJECT static PUT (_fast_a_putstatic/_fast_init_a_putstatic): store_to_object emits
+        // the SAME write barrier as an instance aputfield (the holder mirror is a heap object, so
+        // FieldAddress is a HeapAddress). The object static GET already uses _fast_1_getstatic (a
+        // 1-word load, covered above); a final object-static get no longer bakes a moveable
+        // referent -- Value::set_immediate_from_static_field skips the object immediate on MIPS
